# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Documentation: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Foxglove-style view links (/<org>/view?…, /~/view?…) use the same query parameters as ours.
# Fold the path into the app root; Cloudflare keeps the query string on redirects.
/:org/view   /   302
/:org/view/  /   302
